o recursively 100 times and upload it to YouTube, download it again, reupload it, download it again, host it on Google Drive, get a Google Gemini agent to describe each image in words and then use API credits to get OpenAI to generate an image based on the description it's fine. 5 days per frame seems reasonable it's no problem at all. (I've actually just spent 2 billion tokens and more than 5 days on getting zero frames.)</p>","sentences":[{"en":"If it takes Sol 5 days to reencode an HD video recursively 100 times and upload it to YouTube, download it again, reupload it, download it again, host it on Google Drive, get a Google Gemini agent to describe each image in words and then use API credits to get OpenAI to generate an image based on the description it's fine.","zh":"如果 Sol 需要 5 天的时间来递归地重新编码一个高清视频 100 次并将其上传到 YouTube，再次下载，重新上传，再次下载，将其托管在 Google Drive 上，让 Google Gemini 代理用文字描述每个图像，然后使用 API 积分让 OpenAI 根据描述生成图像，这没问题。"},{"en":"5 days per frame seems reasonable it's no problem at all.","zh":"每帧 5 天似乎很合理，完全没有问题。"},{"en":"(I've actually just spent 2 billion tokens and more than 5 days on getting zero frames.)","zh":"（实际上我刚刚花费了 20 亿代币和超过 5 天的时间来获得零帧。）"}]},{"html_en":"<p>do whatever you need to. this page tracks how long you've failed to deliver any solution.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"do whatever you need to.","zh":"做任何你需要做的事。"},{"en":"this page tracks how long you've failed to deliver any solution.","zh":"此页面跟踪您未能提供任何解决方案的时间有多长。"}]},{"html_en":"<p>Sol Started This Project On:</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Sol Started This Project On:","zh":"Sol 开始这个项目的时间："}]},{"html_en":"<p>It's now been:</p>","sentences":[{"en":"It's now been:","zh":"现在已经是："}]},{"html_en":"<figcaption>2026-08-09 21:10:27 CEST · ELAPSED: 000:00:56:15</figcaption>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<figcaption>2026-08-09 21:41:23 CEST · ELAPSED: 000:01:27:11</figcaption>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<figcaption>2026-08-09 22:11:32 CEST · ELAPSED: 000:01:57:20</figcaption>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<figcaption>2